{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HELLO"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島県出身"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校１年生"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４月23日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日で16歳になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田まあやです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46に入ったのは中１の夏"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に月日がたつのは長いようで本当にあっという間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に入って今までの生活とは一変したぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何もかもが初めてで......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に色々なことがあったなぁ......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13歳で一人暮らしという決断を選び上京してきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右も左もわからないまま、ただただ走り続けてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事に家事に勉強に......両立するのは本当に物凄く物凄く強い根性がいりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直に言うと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなり両立辛かった。ほんとに辛かった。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも乗り越えてこれたのは、\nまあやの回りには沢山のあたたかい人達が居たからです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから頑張ろう！って思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先のことなんてわかりません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１年後自分が何してるのかも想像できない......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3年前の私にも\nまさか東京でアイドルしてるなんて全く思ってなかった。w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通の田舎の子で、夏でも日焼けなんて気にしてなかった！  笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何がおこるかわからないけど、\n自分を信じて、大切な回りの皆を信じて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも前を向いて頑張っていこうと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにも大切な人達に囲まれて\n感謝で一杯です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやに会いに行けないけど\n応援してるよ！\nってコメントで伝えてくれる方も、気持ちは一緒です！！ありがとっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも沢山手作りの可愛い飾りつけをしてもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しくて写真を沢山撮っちゃったのでまたモバイルメールの方で送りますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆、仕事が忙しい中、大変なのに...\nこの日の為に沢山考えてしてくれて...お花も...手紙も......プレゼントも......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く凄く感謝してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーも沢山きてくれて ありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥もお手紙読んでくれて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやより先に泣いちゃったね...... 笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに今飛鳥と連絡とってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Rの法則晩御飯食べながら見たこととか話してるっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんに皆が一生懸命作って盛大に祝ってくれた生誕の写真を送ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「涙が溢れて溢れて、見たいのに見れない...感謝で一杯...」\nって言ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に喜んでました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に有り難う御座います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも宜しくお願いします\nまあやと出会ってくれて有難う♪おかけまでまあやは幸せですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶち好きじゃけぇぇぇ   (//∇//)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田まあや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/23/9986736/0001.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}